WEBVTT

NOTE key=28ec39e0ebe6835c

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.752
Two seeds lay side by side in the spring earth.

2
00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:06.491
The first said, "I want to grow. I will send my roots down."

3
00:00:06.991 --> 00:00:09.905
"I will push my stem up and open my leaves to the sun."

4
00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:11.136
And it did.

5
00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:14.550
The second said, "It is dark down here, but it is safe."

6
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.046
"If I send my roots down, who knows what I will meet?"

7
00:00:18.546 --> 00:00:20.821
"If I push up, someone may step on me."

8
00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.051
"I will wait until it is safer."

9
00:00:23.551 --> 00:00:24.387
And it waited.

10
00:00:24.887 --> 00:00:28.904
A few days later a hen came, scratched the ground, and ate it.
